	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quem tantopere comendaveratis michi Iudeum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die Rede ist wohl von jenem nicht namentlich bekannten getauften Juden, der sich zuvor in <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> aufgehalten hatte (s. oben <ref target="file11494">Nr. 1451</ref>).</note> tu, <persName ref="p1753">Leo</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName>, huic tantum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>opis tuli apud senatum, ut tam ille quam filius egregie sit vestitus; nam uterque thorace<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> thoracae.</note>, tibialibus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et toga est donatus additis duobus aureis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quoniam praevenerat eum alius sui generis, qui pariter <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vestitus alitur stipendio dominorum, <placeName ref="l28">Basilęam</placeName> concessit inde rediturus <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tulit et <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ab aliis bonis viris elemosinam, ut puto, ad tres aut quatuor aureos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed ecce, dum illum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>a prandio ablegaveram, venit ad cęnam hic frater minorita<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Unbekannt.</note>, qui ait ex <placeName ref="l2800">Sardinia</placeName> se natum, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aliquamdiu tamen vitam egisse in <placeName ref="l2802">Apulia</placeName>, ubi quum de religione nostra disserere audiebat, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cupivit eam experiri et imitari.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Venit igitur recta nunc ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> primo petiit <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>forsan ideo, quod sperabat hic in provintia nova<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">D. h. in den 1536 von <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> eroberten <placeName ref="l2478">savoyischen</placeName> Gebieten.</note> locum reperire posse<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage korrigiert aus</hi> posset.</note>, ut sese ex monachismo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>extricaret, evangelio autem Christi nomen daret.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed quia ignorat linguam <placeName ref="l832">Gallicam</placeName>, Latinam et <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l822">Germanicam</placeName>, noluit eum senatus recipere, ubi videbat nullius usus<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> usui.</note> eum futurum nobis, dedit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vero aureum, sed et <persName ref="p3241">Trempius</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p3241">Lienhard Tremp</persName>.</note> ex comuni elemosina quoque aureum addidit, sicque <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> adire co<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nstituit, quod si isthic manere non poterit, perrecturus <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu itaque tibi comendatum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>habeas et, si petiturus esset <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>, fratribus ibidem comendato.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ego vero credo apud <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName> <placeName ref="l648">Rheticam</placeName> ob linguam et<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">et <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> propinquitatem <placeName ref="l834">Italie</placeName> comodius illi prospici potuisse<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">comodius illi prospici potuisse <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>.<pb type="edition" next="76"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ceterum quod petis certior fieri, quid apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>imprimatur: Ferunt<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> Faerunt.</note> catechismum nostrum imprimendum fore; sed quia pars magna voluit, ut illis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>condicionibus imprimeretur, quibus mutatus est post abitum <persName ref="p8412">Gasperi</persName> nostri,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Anfang 1538 war der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Rat durch den Widerstand zwinglisch gesinnter Pfarrer gezwungen worden, den im Vorjahr durch <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> abgeänderten Katechismus <persName ref="p8412">Kaspar Meganders</persName> nochmals zu revidieren; vgl. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> <ref target="file11143">[Nr. 1100]</ref>, S. 49f; <bibl source="b319">Hundeshagen</bibl> 102.</note> alia parte repugnante <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>iussus est <persName ref="p4191">typographus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p4191">Mathias Apiarius</persName>.</note> subsistere, neque audio adhuc a senatu quicquam super hac re deli<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>beratum esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, ex <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName><note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> Valae, ex <placeName ref="l41">Baerna</placeName>.</note>, 11. februarii 1541.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ex animo tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctisismo viro <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> a concionibus sacris, charissimo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Gen <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
